<title>USA: Horizon Bancorp sets stock split, div.</title>
<headline>Horizon Bancorp sets stock split, div.</headline>
<dateline>BECKLEY, W.Va. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon Bancorp Inc on Friday said it has approved a 2-for-1 stock split, to be made in the form of a dividend, and set a fourth-quarter cash payout of $0.17 a share.</p>
<p>The split and the dividend are payable December 15 to shareholders of record on December 1.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be paid on all outstanding shares, including those issued as a result of the split.</p>
</text>
